  "confirmedContract": [
    "Explicit separate CF001 confirmation authority is checked before original inventory status updates; returned failures prevent _updateCS/_update.",
    "Original GetSlipConfirmProgram delegates to CheckAuthorityOnoffConfirmSlipAction; server rules are outside the cached client scope.",
    "Purchase FAQ states purchase-entry import lists confirmed purchase orders and directs master/settings administrator to per-user slip status management type.",
    "Production-only supplement describes ID + business exceptions, priority, requester types5/6 and approver types1–3; this is not a purchase-specific definition of all six types."
  ],
  "confirmedGap": [
    "Missing user/business-specific confirmation policy in own permissions/settings/status transition. SelfSettingsUI lists 전표상태관리유형 but has no action and shows 미확인.",
    "Own purchase import sourceOptions already filters C.active; unconfirmed PO exclusion exists statically, so no duplicate feature change or unchanged regression was run."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Actual type1–6 table including initial confirmation, modification reset, manual confirm/unconfirm and affected business scope; do not infer purchase behavior from account etax or production examples.",
    "Default and ID/business exception evaluation priority, master/settings-admin bypass and separate authorization scope, readonly editor apply/save/cancel behavior.",
    "Own policy design must cover entry save, list transitions, convert/import, linked progress and legacy backups without silently changing existing users/documents; implementation only after contract evidence.",
    "EC-HELP-REQUEST-007 and008 full online manual bodies remain unread. Original session last known login; no authentication guessing or main-row/settings writes."
  ],
